			"notes": "The recruit message, town-join follow-up buttons, and global ad reminder no\nlonger copy their text to the clipboard on click. Clicking now fills the chat\nbar with the text instead, so you can see it, edit it, and press Enter to\nsend.\n\nAlso fixed deployToMods: it previously hard-coded the local Modrinth launcher\nprofile folder to \"26.1.2\", but the launcher had renamed the real profile to\n\"26.1.2 (1)\" (it suffixes duplicates), so local builds were silently landing\nin an unused profile. Only affects building from source; not relevant to a\nModrinth install."
		},
