			"notes": "First release for Minecraft 26.2.\n\n- Ported to 26.2: unobfuscated Mojang mappings throughout, Fabric API 0.158.0+26.2,\n  Loader 0.19.3, Loom 1.17, Java 25.\n- Fixed a 26.2-only compile break: the current screen moved from `Minecraft` onto\n  `Gui` (`Minecraft#setScreen` -> `Gui#setScreen`), caught by a new CI build added\n  in this branch.\n- `/recruit` now requires the command source be \"attended\" (typed by you, not\n  triggered by a server-sent clickable text component), since it can change your\n  config.\n- The recruit message, town-join follow-up buttons, and global ad reminder no\n  longer copy their text to the clipboard on click. Clicking now fills the chat\n  bar with the text instead, so you can see it, edit it, and press Enter to send."
		},
